<%# The reply to the page's ask (4e): asks again in 20 seconds (poll) while `asking` and, when the AI assistant changed
    what the page shows since it was opened, says so with Refresh, which reloads the page as it is, its open tab kept.
    Only the page's frame carries the address it asks: a reply's frame never does. %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag "assistant_changes" do %>
  <div <%= tag.attributes(data: { controller: "poll", poll_interval_value: 20_000 }) if asking %>>
    <% if said %>
      <div class="assistant-changes" role="status" data-controller="reload">
        <span><%= said %></span>
        <button type="button" class="btn small primary" data-action="reload#now">Refresh</button>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
<% end %>
